Expose Wayle's dashboard to the external Waybar and tailor the dashboard for
this desktop.

Wayle's own bar stays hidden.  A one-pixel transparent layer-shell host keeps
the native dashboard popover available, and com.wayle.Shell1.DashboardToggle
lets Waybar open and close it.  The user-session action card is omitted, and
the old binary Power Saver quick action becomes a Power Profile control that
cycles through the profiles actually offered by power-profiles-daemon.

